Job title: US-NY-NYC: Mod_Perl/SQL/Linux Developers

Company name: Leading Information Solution provider

Internal ID: LEK1108

Location: United States, NY, New York

Pay rate: Commensurate with experience

Travel: 0%

Terms of employment: Salaried employee

Length of employment: Permanent

Hours: Full time

Onsite: yes

Description:
As an open source shop, our client develops exciting and unique solutions
from the ground up and have the opportunity to understand how things work
at the lowest levels, and modify things to work as desired.  Development is
collaborative and in discussions, there is no �X says so,� but rather an
idea or a way of doing things based on common sense and consensus.  Little
specialization, lots of discussion and learning.

The development process is not fully formalized and developers are required
to wear several hats at times, and be involved from analysis and design
through testing, implementation and support of live systems.

They are looking for Software Engineers with a Unix/Linux/Open Source
background who are proficient in Perl for both mod_perl application
interface development and backend data-processing.  


Required skills:
Perl, Linux/Unix, SQL.	Applicants must be self motivated, organized, able
to communicate with internal clients, and have the ability to both complete
projects independently and work on small teams.


Desired skills:
C, shell scripting, Oracle or MySQL, Javascript, XML, Apache.


